        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=={{ (() => {\n  // This assumes the Google Sheets node outputs columns named:\n  // Destination, Email, HtmlLink, and (optional) Status / Notes\n  const city = $json.Destination ?? $json.Name ?? \"UNKNOWN_CITY\";\n\n  // If you have a rejection feedback field coming from your approval form:\n  const feedback = $json[\"Enter the promt that you want to add to the page\"] \n                ?? $json.Notes \n                ?? \"\";\n\n  return `Act as a web developer.\nTarget City: ${city}\n\n${feedback ? `The user rejected the previous travel guide for ${city}.\nFeedback: \"${feedback}\"\nRewrite the HTML completely and fix the issues based on the feedback.\n` : `Create a detailed HTML travel guide for ${city}.\n`}\n\nINSTRUCTION:\nGenerate the HTML source code for a travel guide page.\nReturn ONLY the raw HTML string. Do NOT use markdown code blocks (like \\` \\` \\`html).\nDo NOT include any introductory text. Start directly with <!DOCTYPE html>.\n\nRules:\n1) Use standard HTML and CSS (internal styles in <style>).\n2) Interactive Map: Use Leaflet.js.\n   - Include Leaflet CSS & JS from unpkg CDN in the <head>.\n   - Do NOT include integrity or crossorigin attributes.\n3) Content:\n   - H1 Title: \"${city}\"\n   - 3 Images (use <img> tags, vary seeds 1,2,3):\n     https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/${encodeURIComponent(city + \" landmark\")}?seed=1\n     https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/${encodeURIComponent(city + \" landmark\")}?seed=2\n     https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/${encodeURIComponent(city + \" landmark\")}?seed=3\n   - Attractions: 5 real top attractions in ${city}.\n     For EACH attraction include: name, latitude, longitude, rating (e.g., 4.6/5).\n4) Map Logic:\n   - Create <div id=\"map\"> with height: 400px.\n   - Create an array of { name, lat, lon, rating }.\n   - Add markers in a loop and show name + rating in popup.\n   - Use map.fitBounds().\n\nFinal Output Format: Pure HTML string only.`;\n})() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
